      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im waking up for this anymore. another shift, another 12 hours of just moving boxes from one side to the other until my back breaks. it feels like i'm just a ghost in a machine. like, if i just stopped showing up, the system wouldn't even blink. i'm nothing.",
